---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Contact — Xabier Ariznabarreta"
  description="Get in touch with Xabier Ariznabarreta. Best channels for research collaboration, draft feedback, or a question about a post."
  current="contact"
  lang="en"
>
  <h1 style="font-size:32px; font-weight:300; letter-spacing:-1.5px; margin:20px 0 20px;">Contact</h1>

  <div class="post-content">
    <p>
      Best reasons to write: a draft you want feedback on, a question about
      something I posted, a research collaboration, or a typo on the site.
    </p>

    <p>
      Worst reasons: cold sales pitches and crypto schemes.
    </p>

    <p>
      Fastest path: <a href="mailto:xabier.ariznabarreta@gmail.com">xabier.ariznabarreta@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      Otherwise: <a href="https://github.com/Xabilimon1" rel="noopener me">GitHub</a> for code discussion.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
